cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use open-anatomy in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: open-anatomy
abstract: >-
  Open, imaging-based human anatomy models built by scripts from openly
  licensed CT data and open body models. Meshes are named by UBERON or FMA IDs
  and released as glTF.
